{"id":"n80663-1-9","stage":4,"title":"파하다 · 完毕","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n80663-1-9-1","ko":"오늘 모임이 있다더니 벌써 집에 왔어?","zh":"听说今天有聚会，怎么已经回家了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모임이","meaning":"聚会","explanation":"모임：聚会；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"모임","audio":"/audio/2485fc53da01e9d64bb6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61519","senseId":"1","lemma":"모임","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있다더니","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；다더니：引用以前听到的话，再说明后来的发现或结果。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"벌써","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"집에","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왔어?","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"2485fc53da01e9d6","term":"모임","zh":"聚会","audio":"/audio/2485fc53da01e9d64bb6.mp3","entryId":"61519","definition":"多人为做某事而聚在一起的行为。","pronunciation":["모임"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"将要完成或进行某件事情。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"d038c1cb7ee215cb","term":"벌써","zh":"已经","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3","entryId":"58977","definition":"比想象早地。","pronunciation":["벌써"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/09c57b9173a3658bf110.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n80663-1-9-2","ko":"내일 일찍 일어나야 해서 술자리를 금방 파했어.","zh":"我明天得早起，所以很快就结束了喝酒的聚会。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내일","meaning":"明天，明日","explanation":"내일：明天，明日","readings":[{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30193","senseId":"1","lemma":"내일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일찍","meaning":"早早儿","explanation":"일찍：早早儿","readings":[{"term":"일찍","audio":"/audio/6b45c134c531ab187881.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26226","senseId":"1","lemma":"일찍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일어나야","meaning":"起，起床，起来","explanation":"일어나다：起，起床，起来；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"일어나다","audio":"/audio/d57c47b0949440ff623b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71696","senseId":"2","lemma":"일어나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해서","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"술자리를","meaning":"酒席，酒局","explanation":"술자리：酒席，酒局；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"술자리","audio":"/audio/b101ac71541d7750e721.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65373","senseId":"1","lemma":"술자리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"금방","meaning":"马上，立刻，立马","explanation":"금방：马上，立刻，立马","readings":[{"term":"금방","audio":"/audio/08c341712591f51e062b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34764","senseId":"3","lemma":"금방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"파했어.","meaning":"完毕","explanation":"파하다：完毕；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"파하다","audio":"/audio/517d695b1e3abaa3e199.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80663","senseId":"1","lemma":"파하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1e07b94ba5182a41","term":"내일","zh":"明天，明日","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3","entryId":"30193","definition":"今天的下一天。","pronunciation":["내일"]},{"id":"6b45c134c531ab18","term":"일찍","zh":"早早儿","audio":"/audio/6b45c134c531ab187881.mp3","entryId":"26226","definition":"比指定时间早地。","pronunciation":["일찍"]},{"id":"d57c47b0949440ff","term":"일어나다","zh":"起，起床，起来","audio":"/audio/d57c47b0949440ff623b.mp3","entryId":"71696","definition":"从睡眠中醒来。","pronunciation":["이러나다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"b101ac71541d7750","term":"술자리","zh":"酒席，酒局","audio":"/audio/b101ac71541d7750e721.mp3","entryId":"65373","definition":"喝酒的场合。","pronunciation":["술짜리"]},{"id":"08c341712591f51e","term":"금방","zh":"马上，立刻，立马","audio":"/audio/08c341712591f51e062b.mp3","entryId":"34764","definition":"时间过去不久，很快。","pronunciation":["금방"]},{"id":"517d695b1e3abaa3","term":"파하다","zh":"完毕","audio":"/audio/517d695b1e3abaa3e199.mp3","entryId":"80663","definition":"某事结束；或指结束或放弃某事。","pronunciation":["파ː하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fde093b041532fceb47b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.937,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=80663","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourc